OL,3,GNEWSA'Brave' workers battle in vain to
OL,4,Asave man in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 80s has died in a house
OL,7,Ffire in Lincolnshire despite the "brave
OL,8,Fefforts" of nearby workers who tried to
OL,9,Fhelp, police have said.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FCraypool Lane, in Scothern, at about
OL,13,F11:00 GMT on Monday.
OL,15,FLincolnshire Police confirmed the death
OL,16,Fand said it was working with
OL,17,FLincolnshire Fire and Rescue Service to
OL,18,Festablish the circumstances surrounding
OL,19,Fthe fire.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
