OL,3,GNEWSA'Brave' workers battle in vain to
OL,4,Asave man in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Michael Head, of local policing
OL,7,Ffor West Lindsey, said: "I would like
OL,8,Fto thank the local community and some
OL,9,Fworkers who were in the area and who
OL,10,Fdid everything they could to fight the
OL,11,Ffire. Despite their very brave efforts
OL,12,Fthe fire had taken hold and there
OL,13,Fwasn't anything they could have done."
